  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Configuring Tailwind v4**\n\nI\'m now diving into configuring `src/index.css`. My primary focus is ensuring Tailwind v4 accurately reflects the color tokens, font families, font sizes, spacing, and styles specified in `Image_9_5aa82e3b.markdown`. The aim is to create corresponding classes such as `bg-surface`, `bg-surface-container`, and other appropriate utilities that map to the design\'s specific requirements.\n\n\n**Inspecting Tailwind v4 Implementation**\n\nI\'m now investigating the use of the `@theme` directive in Tailwind v4. It seems quite promising for defining and managing color variables. I\'m focusing on mapping the design\'s color tokens to CSS variables within this theme scope. The initial implementation for several classes is already working well.\n\n\n**Mapping Color Tokens**\n\nNow I\'m focusing on incorporating the color token definitions directly into the Tailwind configuration. I\'m assigning the provided hex codes to corresponding CSS variables within a dedicated theme. This approach ensures consistent color management across the project, making future updates significantly easier. I\'m aiming for a straightforward mapping between token names and variable assignments.\n\n\n**Defining Design Properties**\n\nI\'m now integrating the provided design properties directly into the Tailwind configuration. I\'m focusing on defining CSS variables for color values like `--color-on-error-container` and `--color-surface-container-lowest`. Additionally, I\'m defining spacing variables (e.g., `--spacing-gutter`, `--spacing-space-sm`) and font families (e.g., `--font-sans`, `--font-body-sm`) to ensure consistency and easier styling updates across the design. I will also create typography utility classes to facilitate styling.\n\n\n**Implementing Typography Utilities**\n\nI\'m now generating utility classes for each of the provided typography styles, from display to label sizes. These styles are mapped to Tailwind classes like `font-display-lg`, `font-headline-md`, and so on. Also, I am integrating safe area padding classes, such as `.pt-safe` into the stylesheet, making the design responsive to various device safe-area contexts.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5397"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@theme {\\n  --color-secondary-fixed-dim: #4edea3;\\n  --color-secondary: #006c49;\\n  --color-background: #faf8ff;\\n  --color-surface-dim: #d2d9f4;\\n  --color-on-tertiary-fixed-variant: #653e00;\\n  --color-on-secondary-fixed-variant: #005236;\\n  --color-tertiary-container: #825100;\\n  --color-tertiary-fixed-dim: #ffb95f;\\n  --color-on-secondary: #ffffff;\\n  --color-secondary-container: #6cf8bb;\\n  --color-on-background: #131b2e;\\n  --color-on-tertiary: #ffffff;\\n  --color-outline-variant: #c4c5d7;\\n  --color-on-tertiary-fixed: #2a1700;\\n  --color-on-tertiary-container: #ffcb8f;\\n  --color-inverse-on-surface: #eef0ff;\\n  --color-on-primary-container: #cad3ff;\\n  --color-surface-bright: #faf8ff;\\n  --color-on-secondary-fixed: #002113;\\n  --color-secondary-fixed: #6ffbbe;\\n  --color-on-surface-variant: #434655;\\n  --color-on-primary-fixed-variant: #0039b5;\\n  --color-primary-container: #1d4ed8;\\n  --color-tertiary: #623c00;\\n  --color-surface-container: #eaedff;\\n  --color-surface: #faf8ff;\\n  --color-on-secondary-container: #00714d;\\n  --color-outline: #747686;\\n  --color-surface-tint: #2151da;\\n  --color-surface-container-low: #f2f3ff;\\n  --color-surface-variant: #dae2fd;\\n  --color-on-error: #ffffff;\\n  --color-primary: #0037b0;\\n  --color-on-primary: #ffffff;\\n  --color-error-container: #ffdad6;\\n  --color-primary-fixed-dim: #b7c4ff;\\n  --color-primary-fixed: #dce1ff;\\n  --color-tertiary-fixed: #ffddb8;\\n  --color-surface-container-highest: #dae2fd;\\n  --color-inverse-surface: #283044;\\n  --color-on-primary-fixed: #001551;\\n  --color-surface-container-high: #e2e7ff;\\n  --color-inverse-primary: #b7c4ff;\\n  --color-error: #ba1a1a;\\n  --color-on-surface: #131b2e;\\n  --color-on-error-container: #93000a;\\n  --color-surface-container-lowest: #ffffff;\\n\\n  --spacing-gutter: 1rem;\\n  --spacing-margin: 1rem;\\n  --spacing-space-xs: 0.25rem;\\n  --spaci