  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the `Header.tsx` component. The goal is a perfect replica of the HTML screens\' top bar. It will be a fixed header with a blur backdrop, display the LabReserve logo, and dynamically show the current screen subtitle like \"In\303\255cio\" or \"Nova Reserva\". I think this is a foundational step for the overall UI consistency.\n\n\n**Adding Interactive Elements**\n\nI\'ve moved on to interactive elements. I\'m adding a back button for sub-screens, a notification button with an unread count, and the professor\'s avatar, which opens a profile modal. The `BottomNav.tsx` component is next, aiming for a fixed bottom tab bar with four tabs identical to the HTML files.\n\n\n**Developing the Homepage**\n\nI\'m now diving into the homepage design. I\'m focusing on a \"hero\" card that will highlight the next class. Quick actions are next, followed by a list of upcoming reservations. The goal is to provide easy access to key information and actions.\n\n\\n\\n\n\nNow I\'m designing the reservation wizard component (`ReservationWizard.tsx`). The first step encompasses the requirements. I\'m focusing on the stepper and gathering data like subject, class, student count (with dynamic controls and capacity warnings), date, time, and software/environment details. The primary call-to-action will be to find available labs based on these inputs.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Reservation Flow**\n\nI\'m now focusing on step two of the reservation process, adding a visual representation. I\'m implementing the applied filters and the \"laborat\303\263rios encontrados\" summary card. I\'ll need to display the lab cards, including compatibility details and actions, and I\'m designing the sticky bottom sheet with the selected lab and a button to advance to the review phase. I\'m visualizing the final booking confirmation step, including the success message and a \"boarding pass\" ticket for the user.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1740869"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { PROFESSOR_PROFILE } from \'../data/mockData\';\\n\\ninterface HeaderProps {\\n  subtitle: string;\\n  showBack?: boolean;\\n  onBack?: () => void;\\n  onOpenNotifications?: () => void;\\n  onOpenProfile?: () => void;\\n  unreadCount?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Header: React.FC<HeaderProps> = ({\\n  subtitle,\\n  showBack = false,\\n  onBack,\\n  onOpenNotifications,\\n  onOpenProfile,\\n  unreadCount = 2,\\n}) => {\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 bg-surface/85 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_1px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] pt-safe border-b border-outline-variant/20\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-xl mx-auto h-16 px-gutter flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-space-sm\\\">\\n          {showBack && (\\n            <button\\n              aria-label=\\\"Voltar\\\"\\n              className=\\\"w-10 h-10 -ml-2 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface hover:text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors active:scale-95\\\"\\n              onClick={onBack}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]\\\">arrow_back</span>\\n            </button>\\n          )}\\n\\n          <div\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none\\\"\\n            onClick={() => onBack && showBack ? onBack() : null}\\n          >\\n            <img\\n              alt=\\\"LabReserve Logo\\\"\\n              className=\\\"h-8 w-auto object-contain shrink-0\\\"\\n              src={PROFESSOR_PROFILE.logoUrl}\\n              onError={(e) => {\\n                // Graceful fallback SVG icon if external network is blocked\\n                const target = e.currentTarget;\\n                target.style.display = \'none\';\\n                target.parentElement?.insertAdjacentHTML(\\n                  \'afterbegin\',\\n                  \'<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[28px] mr-1\\\">computer</span>\'\\n                );\\n              }}\\n            />\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col min-w-0\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary leading-none font-bold\\\">\\n                LabReserve\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-none mt-0.5 truncate max-w-[170px]\\\">\\n                {subtitle}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-space-sm\\\">\\n          <button\\n            aria-label=\\\"Notifica\303\247\303\265es\\\"\\n            className=\\\"relative w-11 h-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors\\\"\\n            onClick={onOpenNotifications}\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]\\\">notifications</span>\\n            {unreadCount > 0 && (\\n              <span className=\\\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-secondary ring-2 ring-surface animate-pulse\\\" />\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            aria-label=\\\"Perfil do Usu\303\241rio\\\"\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-space-xs rounded-full p-0.5 hover:ring-2 hover:ring-primary-container transition-all active:scale-95\\\"\\n            onClick={onOpenProfile}\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          >\\n            <img\\n              alt=\\\"Foto do Prof. Andr\303\251\\\"\\n              className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-primary-fixed\\\"\\n              src={PROFESSOR_PROFILE.avatarUrl}\\n              onError={(e) => {\\n                const target = e.currentTarget;\\n                target.src = \'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=120&q=80\';\\n              }}\\n            />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create Header component with logo, title, notifications, and profile triggers\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Header.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Header component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Header.tsx\"}"
