  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing The HomeScreen**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `HomeScreen.tsx` component. The aim is pixel-perfect accuracy to the provided image assets. I\'m starting with the top greeting section, replicating the text and incorporating the calendar icon with the emerald badge. Next up: the Bento Metric Strip, I\'m working on how best to structure this using the available UI components.\n\n\n**Defining the Bento Metrics**\n\nI\'ve moved on from the hero card to define the bento metrics. I\'ve designed the visual hierarchy for three \"Reservas Ativas\", \"1 Pendente TI\", and a \"98% Taxa de Aprov.\" metric strip. Each will have an accompanying icon for visual clarity. Then the hero card focuses on the \"Pr\303\263xima Aula Agendada\" with a pulsing dot, a time badge, and a \"Confirmada\" status pill. I\'m focusing on the component\'s interactive elements and data display now.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1277996"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { Reservation } from \'../types\';\\n\\ninterface HomeScreenProps {\\n  reservations: Reservation[];\\n  onStartReservation: () => void;\\n  onViewLabs: () => void;\\n  onOpenSoftwareRequest: () => void;\\n  onOpenQrModal: (reservation: Reservation) => void;\\n  onViewReservationTicket: (reservation: Reservation) => void;\\n  onViewAllHistory: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const HomeScreen: React.FC<HomeScreenProps> = ({\\n  reservations,\\n  onStartReservation,\\n  onViewLabs,\\n  onOpenSoftwareRequest,\\n  onOpenQrModal,\\n  onViewReservationTicket,\\n  onViewAllHistory,\\n}) => {\\n  // Count metrics\\n  const activeCount = reservations.filter((r) => r.status === \'confirmada\').length;\\n  const pendingCount = reservations.filter((r) => r.status === \'aguardando_ti\').length;\\n\\n  // Next class spotlight\\n  const nextClass = reservations.find((r) => r.id === \'res-next-today\') || reservations[0];\\n\\n  // Upcoming items (exclude the spotlight if already shown)\\n  const upcomingList = reservations.filter((r) => r.id !== nextClass?.id).slice(0, 3);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex flex-col w-full pb-8\\\">\\n      {/* Top Greeting & Department Context */}\\n      <section className=\\\"px-gutter pt-4 pb-2\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <h1 className=\\\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight font-bold\\\">\\n                Ol\303\241, Prof. Andr\303\251\\n              </h1>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xl animate-bounce\\\">\360\237\221\213</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1 mt-0.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary\\\">school</span>\\n              Departamento de Ci\303\252ncia da Computa\303\247\303\243o\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onViewAllHistory}\\n            className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-primary shadow-sm relative active:scale-95 transition-transform\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Ver agenda\\\"\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">calendar_today</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"absolute top-2 right-2 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary\\\"></span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* Metric Counters Bento Strip */}\\n      <section className=\\\"px-gutter py-3\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5\\\">\\n          {/* Card 1: Reservas Ativas */}\\n          <div\\n            onClick={onViewAllHistory}\\n            className=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden cursor-pointer hover:shadow-md transition-all active:scale-[0.98]\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute -right-2 -bottom-2 w-12 h-12 bg-primary/5 rounded-full pointer-events-none\\\"></div>\\n            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]\\\">event_available</span>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-2\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface block leading-tight font-bold\\\">\\n                {activeCount}\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-1\\\">\\n                Reservas Ativas\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Card 2: Pendente TI */}\\n          <div\\n            onClick={onOpenSoftwareRequest}\\n            className=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden cursor-pointer hover:shadow-md transition-all active:scale-[0.98]\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute -right-2 -bottom-2 w-12 h-12 bg-tertiary-fixed/30 rounded-full pointer-events-none\\\"></div>\\n            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary-container text-[20px]\\\">pending_actions</span>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-2\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface block leading-tight font-bold\\\">\\n                {pendingCount}\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-1\\\">\\n                Pendente TI\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Card 3: Taxa de Aprov. */}\\n          <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute -right-2 -bottom-2 w-12 h-12 bg-secondary-container/40 rounded-full pointer-events-none\\\"></div>\\n            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]\\\">verified</span>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-2\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-secondary block leading-tight font-bold\\\">\\n                98%\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-1\\\">\\n                Taxa de Aprov.\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* Next Class Spotlight Hero Card */}\\n      {nextClass && (\\n        <section className=\\\"px-gutter py-2\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary animate-pulse\\\"></span>\\n              <h2 className=\\\"font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">\\n                Pr\303\263xima Aula Agendada\\n              </h2>\\n            </div>\\n            <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-semibold bg-primary-fixed/40 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\\\">\\n              Hoje\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-md flex flex-col gap-3 relative overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant/30\\\">\\n            {/* Decorative Backdrop Geometry */}\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-32 h-32 bg-primary-fixed/20 rounded-full pointer-events-none blur-xl\\\"></div>\\n\\n            {/* Time and Status Header */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between relative z-10\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\\\">schedule</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-md text-label-md\\\">\\n                  {nextClass.startTime} - {nextClass.endTime}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-secondary-container/60 text-on-secondary-container px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary\\\"></span>\\n                {nextClass.status === \'confirmada\' ? \'Confirmada\' : \'Aguardando TI\'}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Class & Lab Metadata */}\\n            <div className=\\\"relative z-10\\\">\\n              <h3 className=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-bold tracking-tight\\\">\\n                {nextClass.subject}\\n              </h3>\\n              <p className=\\\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1 mt-1\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary\\\">computer</span>\\n                <span>{nextClass.labName}</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-outline-variant\\\">\342\200\242</span>\\n                <span>{nextClass.location}</span>\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Capacity & Tech Stack Pills */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 relative z-10 pt-1\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg font-label-sm text-label-sm font-medium\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\\\">groups</span>\\n                {nextClass.studentsCount} Alunos\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg font-label-sm text-label-sm font-medium\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\\\">code</span>\\n                {nextClass.requiredSoftware.slice(0, 3).join(\' \342\200\242 \')}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* QR Code Access Action Button */}\\n            <div className=\\\"pt-2 relative z-10\\\">\\n              <button\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-primary hover:bg-on-primary-fixed-variant active:scale-[0.99] transition-all text-on-primary h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-label-lg text-label-lg font-semibold shadow-sm cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                id=\\\"btn-qr-access\\\"\\n                onClick={() => onOpenQrModal(nextClass)}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">qr_code_2</span>\\n                Ver C\303\263digo de Acesso / QR\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Quick Actions Grid */}\\n      <section className=\\\"px-gutter py-3\\\">\\n        <h2 className=\\\"font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface mb-2.5 font-semibold\\\">\\n          A\303\247\303\265es R\303\241pidas\\n        </h2>\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n          {/* Main Primary Action */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onStartReservation}\\n            className=\\\"w-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary p-3.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between shadow-sm active:scale-[0.99] transition-transform cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest/20 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]\\\">add_circle</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col text-left\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-lg text-label-lg leading-tight font-bold\\\">\\n                  Fazer Nova Reserva\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-primary-container\\\">\\n                  Alocar computadores ou salas tem\303\241ticas\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">arrow_forward</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Secondary Quick Actions (2-column layout) */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={onViewLabs}\\n              className=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm text-left h-24 hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors cursor-pointer border border-outline-variant/20\\\"\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\\\">grid_view</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-label-md text-label-md line-clamp-2 font-semibold\\\">\\n                Consultar Grade de Labs\\n              </span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={onOpenSoftwareRequest}\\n              className=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm text-left h-24 hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors cursor-pointer border border-outline-variant/20\\\"\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-tertiary-container/10 text-tertiary-container flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\\\">build</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-label-md text-label-md line-clamp-2 font-semibold\\\">\\n                Solicitar Instala\303\247\303\243o de Software\\n              </span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* Upcoming Reservations List */}\\n      <section className=\\\"px-gutter py-2 flex flex-col gap-2.5\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n          <h2 className=\\\"font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">\\n            Suas Pr\303\263ximas Reservas\\n          </h2>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onViewAllHistory}\\n            className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\"\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          >\\n            Ver todas ({reservations.length})\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {upcomingList.map((res) => (\\n          <div\\n            key={res.id}\\n            className=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-3.5 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-2.5 border border-outline-variant/20\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                <h4 className=\\\"font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">\\n                  {res.subject}\\n                </h4>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-outline\\\">\\n                    {res.labName.includes(\'Mac\') ? \'desktop_mac\' : res.labName.includes(\'GPU\') ? \'memory\' : \'terminal\'}\\n                  </span>\\n                  {res.labName}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {res.status === \'confirmada\' ? (\\n                <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-secondary-container/50 text-on-secondary-container px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary\\\"></span>\\n                  Confirmada\\n                </span>\\n              ) : res.status === \'aguardando_ti\' ? (\\n                <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-tertiary-fixed text-on-tertiary-fixed-variant px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary-container animate-pulse\\\"></span>\\n                  Aguardando TI\\n                </span>\\n              ) : (\\n                <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\\\">\\n                  Conclu\303\255da\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* TI Ticket Callout if pending */}\\n            {res.itTicket && (\\n              <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary-container text-[16px]\\\">\\n                  hourglass_top\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n                  Chamado {res.itTicket.id}: {res.itTicket.description}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pt-1 text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 text-primary bg-primary-fixed/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\\\">calendar_month</span>\\n                  {res.dateFormatted.split(\',\')[1] || res.dateFormatted}\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm font-medium\\\">\\n                  {res.startTime} - {res.endTime}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <button\\n                aria-label=\\\"Detalhes\\\"\\n                onClick={() => onViewReservationTicket(res)}\\n                className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer active:scale-95\\\"\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\\\">chevron_right</span>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        ))}\\n      </section>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create HomeScreen component matching design and attachments\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/HomeScreen.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating HomeScreen component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create HomeScreen.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\267\020\n\264\020\001i\024}\023Z\250X\241\345I\341\317\311\310V\f\352E?\372\204s&\316\\\202\215\221\0230\257\t\227\331\372\366\"l\227\'\237`\212\350\027\253\364f\364\331\026}\266\254\0311.\30246\314\267\307\346\022\246\b\267\305\035\356\324n\257h&\355\201zz\331\v\207M\233\2044\263\263z\315?\200\271c\344\277<IS\300\006\370`,\213\a\226\034^_\023\017\377\005u1\\\315g\315$\177\333\f\205\304\357\257\b\207\037\nan#\0000\000\224\347\234\267|\250\004g\326A\a~\265\321\032\247[\251\333E\306\0309\002&\342\215M\2306\203[\311\215k$$\300gX\313\311w\306\237\201\272\225\307\315\'\237\347~\350\344f\304\272\261Q\224N\316\331\326\266.\303(\255\332\320\351\v\234\230J_\277pi\a\261\210=e\3444\026h\324\a\a\233\375\321\244Y\262X\234\020\250)\306\265h\260\023\245\274\273\324\360\016\203\321\3315\346%\023\006\262\220\203,\221`\n\3235\305\037\226\a\022\311\272\357\222#g\276\004\3561\321\236e\033\fG\f\263\303\025}B\244\273\003\262\031:\326\024.Z\224\377\023\245\302\272\304\n\264PA\253\"VuD\225/\304\357\233\372\374\263R\310T\233\372\273\233\277\253/G\226\236\202\223\326\301\372\235\325\3337\213\330\031\'\355j\225\'\216\213\213\267\243\361*\267>\304aR\344\r\255\372\260\017_\214\024\357\377\016\022\231\267_\341\257\211\305 Z\324\006\001G5\354\213x[\352\f9m\337\256\357\311(\003\203\223\320t\302\032\'2i\321\307\234\226_J;\341I\025!\000E\346E\f|\305\315sH\272s\020\325.=L\272\364\227r\316\363\207=\304\207[f%\033\331\360\213i]\230\177\356K\317\\\232\370-\036\371\r\341,E\332\031\276\245\362\311\271\024i\f_i@\365\0001\253\313\356#\316\022a\361A^!f\005\022\371r\345\250\274J0\362x\360\031\201\220K\275WF\336\251\340J0\272\376\367/\333\252\233R\227\233\325Z\022\305\223\235\020^9\261g\266\200\3267\203\377\353=\211;s\023\241\206\212X\266\345S\325\270\347\037\245|0)U]\0308\236B\302@\036\032\274\023^dN7n\214M\177\267\237F\241\337\367\322\371\227\370&\251`\03727\022\311\003\0017b$y9\271\374\355S\345\275F\372t\"\353\215\300\331\36318\360\2768n\305\"\212X\226\312\023\254\255\374{\22