  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating Mock Data**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `src/data/mockData.ts` file. My goal is to standardize the lab codes using the \"Bloco + N\303\272mero\" format. So far, I\'ve added two example labs: `B204` representing Block B, 2nd floor, room 204 with 40 stations, and `A102` which is Block A, 1st floor, room 102 with 35 stations. I want to continue with this approach.\n\n\n**Expanding Mock Data**\n\nI\'ve added more lab entries to the mock data: `C302`, `C108`, `B112`, and `D004`, each with associated information like floor, room number, and station count. I\'m also including an administrator profile for Eng. Roberto Ramos and some sample reservations: a confirmed one, a pending approval, an approved one, a waiting approval and a rejected one with a justification to make the data more realistic. I am now working on seeding these reservation examples into the `src/data/mockData.ts` file.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_62925"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { Lab, Reservation, SoftwareCategory, NotificationItem } from \'../types\';\\n\\nexport const INITIAL_LABS: Lab[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'lab-b204\',\\n    code: \'B204\',\\n    name: \'B204 - Laborat\303\263rio de Desenvolvimento\',\\n    category: \'Desenvolvimento & Engenharia de Software\',\\n    block: \'Bloco B\',\\n    floor: \'2\302\272 Andar\',\\n    roomNumber: \'204\',\\n    capacity: 40,\\n    cpu: \'Intel Core i7 13700\',\\n    ram: \'16GB RAM\',\\n    storage: \'SSD 512GB NVMe\',\\n    gpu: \'Intel UHD 770\',\\n    installedSoftware: [\'Android Studio\', \'VS Code\', \'PostgreSQL\', \'Git\', \'Node.js\', \'Docker\', \'JDK 21\'],\\n    airConditioned: true,\\n    projector: \'Projetor 4K Laser\',\\n    whiteBoard: true,\\n    noBreak: true,\\n    availableHours: \'08:00 \303\240s 22:00\',\\n    status: \'livre\',\\n    scheduleSlots: [\\n      {\\n        id: \'slot-1\',\\n        date: \'2023-10-27\',\\n        startTime: \'14:00\',\\n        endTime: \'17:30\',\\n        reservationId: \'res-1\',\\n        subject: \'Desenvolvimento Web & Mobile\',\\n        professorName: \'Prof. Dr. Andr\303\251 Silva\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        id: \'slot-2\',\\n        date: \'2023-10-21\',\\n        startTime: \'14:00\',\\n        endTime: \'16:30\',\\n        reservationId: \'res-next-today\',\\n        subject: \'Estrutura de Dados e Algoritmos\',\\n        professorName: \'Prof. Dr. Andr\303\251 Silva\',\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    image: \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBD2Co1JjGyCh6mgvhBjn8ujEzM6E_2gmAKxWNF4vFNpNflc3hRGBtuHlp6FbWCuWGusIDoi2WTw-Uy8RKT4xZZ1SJVo4nsuY09dWNaNcSsC2WKncGkVZKiRYjBwP3v2ge_fNBmKLEXdes00u6CI_bcSojYsswdCSuzz4yW7T0OEDslcF_XYbLoY_SVE6-n2L5dnIbzBYYIHDBrOHlQlrsHuRexPyZ9srXBasdMDaM22MmtvI9Zj9t2tQ\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'lab-a102\',\\n    code: \'A102\',\\n    name: \'A102 - Inform\303\241tica Geral\',\\n    category: \'Aplica\303\247\303\265es Gerais & Algoritmos\',\\