           <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm\\\">Hist\303\263rico</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update BottomNav with role-aware tabs and desktop hiding\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/BottomNav.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating BottomNav component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update BottomNav.tsx\"}"
